    "all": "Godot fonts, tracking, colours, anti-aliasing, panel tint, spacing, borders and button dimensions differ slightly. HUD uses the approved later-day setup, with Saturday at 10:00 and Sunday at 07:00. Sunday shows Dhuhr where the masters show Friday prayer.",
